# Copy this file to .env (which git ignores) and fill it in. Never commit a real key.
# With a key set, the app runs the director through the Claude API by itself.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# The model that reads the room, and the one that writes the drawings (both default to claude-sonnet-5-5).
# DIRECTOR_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# DRAW_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
